Chapter: LinearCaptureClause
  cites Foreword chapter Linear

 Stage 4 guard: a handler clause body may run zero or many times, so
 a clause that mentions an enclosing linear value is a capture
 violation (CDX2067), even when the mention would otherwise be
 sanctioned.

Section: Effects

  effect Probe where
    poke : [Probe] Integer

Section: Definitions

  bad : linear Integer -> Integer
  bad (n) =
   let r = with Probe poke
     poke (resume) = resume (freeze n)
   in r

  opening : Integer = bad 7

